  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "智慧物聯網",
    "sub_ename": "SMART INTERNET OF THINGS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程講授智慧物聯網硬體及軟體架構及功能，其主題包含國際標準 IEEE 1451 感測介面模組、無線感測網路平台、及智慧物聯網應用。智慧物聯網應用的範疇將包含智慧生活、智慧企業、智慧交通、智慧綠能、和智慧農業。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will teach hardware and software architecture and functions of smart internet of things. The subjects include international standards IEEE 1451 transducer interface modules, wireless sensor network platform, and smart IoT applications. Smart IoT applications will cover smart living, smart business, smart transportation, smart green energy, and smart agriculture.",
